# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# SmartSchemes Backend — Environment Variables
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# Do NOT commit .env to version control.

# ── Server ────────────────────────────────────────
PORT=5000
NODE_ENV=development

# ── Supabase (required) ──────────────────────────
# Get these from: https://supabase.com/dashboard → Project Settings → API
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your_supabase_service_role_key

# ── Gemini AI (optional) ─────────────────────────
# Enables AI-powered chatbot. Without this, chat falls back to rule-based.
# Get from: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key

# ── CORS ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Comma-separated list of allowed origins for CORS.
# Include your local dev ports and deployed frontend URL.
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:5174
FRONTEND_URL=https://your-app.netlify.app

# ── MongoDB Atlas (required) ─────────────────────
# Connection string from: https://cloud.mongodb.com → Connect → Drivers
MONGO_URI=mongodb+srv://USERNAME:PASSWORD@cluster.mongodb.net/?appName=YourApp

# ── Government Scheme Ingestion Pipeline ──────────
# Admin key for invoking /api/admin/schemes/import and data quality endpoints
ADMIN_API_KEY=your_secure_admin_api_key_here

# Open Government Data Platform India (data.gov.in)
# Register at https://data.gov.in/ to generate an API key
DATA_GOV_IN_API_KEY=your_data_gov_in_api_key

# myScheme (myscheme.gov.in) Authorized Partner API
# Only needed if you have authorized partner feed access (No unpermitted scraping)
MYSCHEME_API_URL=
MYSCHEME_API_KEY=

# National Portal of India (india.gov.in) Feed URL (optional)
INDIAGOV_FEED_URL=
